## 📊 Power BI Dashboard

The Power BI dashboard provides an interactive overview of customer purchasing behaviour.

### Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)

- Total Number of Customers
- Average Purchase Amount
- Average Review Rating

### Data Visualizations

- Customer Distribution by Subscription Status
- Revenue by Product Category
- Sales by Product Category
- Revenue by Age Group
- Sales by Age Group

### Interactive Filters (Slicers)

- Subscription Status
- Gender
- Product Category
- Shipping Type

### Dashboard Design

The dashboard features a modern **Dark Navy theme** with:

- Deep navy background
- Electric blue and cyan accents
- Purple highlights
- High-contrast text
- Interactive filters and visualizations

---

## 💡 Key Business Recommendations

Based on the analysis areas explored in this project, the following recommendations can help businesses improve customer engagement and purchasing performance.

- **Subscription Growth:** Promote subscriber benefits and encourage non-subscribers to explore subscription options.

- **Customer Loyalty:** Introduce loyalty programs and rewards to encourage repeat purchases.

- **Discount Optimization:** Evaluate discount-dependent products and improve promotional strategies.

- **Product Performance:** Focus on popular and highly rated products to improve customer engagement.

- **Customer Segmentation:** Develop targeted marketing strategies based on customer demographics and purchasing behaviour.

- **Shipping Optimization:** Analyse shipping preferences to improve fulfilment strategies and customer satisfaction.

